\item \eqn{z_i = 1 - w_i^{\lambda} = 1 - [1-(1-x_i^{\alpha})^{\beta}]^{\lambda}}
}
This function computes \eqn{-\ell(\theta|\mathbf{x})}.

Numerical stability is prioritized using:
